ight-click a repository tab to copy its path.","Remote workspaces: you can now initialize a new repository on a remote host. Choose the host in the Initialize repository dialog, pick an empty folder or type the path of a new one, and the repository opens in a remote tab. Hosts need changes allowed and receive an updated GitLama helper on their next connection.","Deleting a remote branch, or pushing or deleting a tag, no longer fails with \"The transfer request is invalid.\" when you have no local branch of that name."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.42-43","version":"0.1.0-beta.42"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":23951864,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.41-42-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"343b9ea42045bb60ecd997c6c45cea5ade05aad01ba966baec470318744f12ff","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.41-42/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.41-42-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":25085880,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.41-42-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"51c9f53068cba946722dd8807e49693beb209be62b90cafcb63c61902e9c81a4","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.41-42/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.41-42-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":26999646,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.41-42-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_system":"macOS 13.0 and Git 2.39","platform":"macos","sha256":"d237e9997fbba7d28dc82c3cadb1dd49eb329b83258cd64f50398dfb5c621c13","update_signature":"cXG8HeKWjiMpnMx2Vjrnfzl1Q+Ola2vdLCR3/R3CRF4QKOU1P5bjt/0c6yfXJ2B2X8P6CpGhGYJSWi5m+3ceBA==","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.41-42/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.41-42-macos-arm64.dmg"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":21381120,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.41-42-windows-x86_64.msi","format":"msi","minimum_system":"Windows 10 version 1809 and Git 2.39","platform":"windows","sha256":"483f73d3e13af6cfbde32336720bc44c705e94a0ee5632066ddf6c2fd476bd70","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.41-42/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.41-42-windows-x86_64.msi"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":25120283,"file":"gitlama-0.1.0-beta.41-42.x86_64.rpm","format":"rpm","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"0ca75cf74ffb815f11e05a41678db21c87549716cdf4a7271800ab7233743f5f","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.41-42/gitlama-0.1.0-beta.41-42.x86_64.rpm"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":25121758,"file":"gitlama_0.1.0-beta.41-42_amd64.deb","format":"deb","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"696fbfd40a9503c439b629a779f43b85efb5582647932bd7a035d9592eac1dd8","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.41-42/gitlama_0.1.0-beta.41-42_amd64.deb"}],"build":42,"channel":"beta","notes":["Remote workspaces: when a host is missing the GitLama helper, for example after an update, you can install it right in the tab that could not connect, and its tabs reopen afterwards.","Remote workspaces: hosts can install the helper automatically, so updates no longer stop you with a missing helper.","Remote workspaces: the new Remote hosts page in Settings lists all your hosts and lets you change their access, automatic installation, name and SSH alias.","Remote workspaces: GitLama updates no longer need a new helper on your hosts unless the helper itself changed. This update installs the helper once more.","Remote workspaces: on hosts where you allow changes you can now merge, cherry-pick, revert, rebase, resolve conflicts, undo and redo, use snapshots and bisect, restore files, apply patches, amend commits, reset branches and manage worktrees, submodules and Git LFS.","Remote workspaces: the status bar shows whether GitLama may only read or also change the current host, and lets you switch it with one click."],"tag":"v0.1.0-bet