d out with the reason instead of being hidden.","The remote folder picker now follows the path as you type it and shows whether that folder exists on the host.","Opening a remote repository from a new tab now uses that tab, as opening a local folder does.","The remote folder picker now starts at the top of each folder you open."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.39-40","version":"0.1.0-beta.39"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":21957112,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.38-39-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"85eed012d3ed889b658124ec0b576b9c766770ec169b920d1d0e82a1dc515e94","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.38-39/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.38-39-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":22911688,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.38-39-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"f3b3abd155732bbb1cbb33c622be333172e4f0d91539f643fdf2e3a47227f332","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.38-39/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.38-39-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":24571075,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.38-39-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_system":"macOS 13.0 and Git 2.39","platform":"macos","sha256":"0e6ebb8d0bb3728d53fbb0d57152c166cb47c4096f7a6ab91e0169df6781966e","update_signature":"oXcC4lKVk1WTsnLrHhxbxHGtNcYIYak8kqHqs0Cx3HmgRCY71QUwAguLMq9441uRziiyP1nHZxqaKyYKDM9vCQ==","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.38-39/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.38-39-macos-arm64.dmg"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":19677184,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.38-39-windows-x86_64.msi","format":"msi","minimum_system":"Windows 10 version 1809 and Git 2.39","platform":"windows","sha256":"c5b6c38f8fc67ee626fd46ec17e97a056b0f25c817f5aa8cc22f35e3916b31b2","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.38-39/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.38-39-windows-x86_64.msi"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":22949003,"file":"gitlama-0.1.0-beta.38-39.x86_64.rpm","format":"rpm","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"2bcec29cd317f11a83c99f6573418bfdda18678b1b7314ca23882bcb9f0c99b7","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.38-39/gitlama-0.1.0-beta.38-39.x86_64.rpm"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":22948564,"file":"gitlama_0.1.0-beta.38-39_amd64.deb","format":"deb","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"5c912ee3b3c49dca46b3f5da305259fcd175d5727b49f6aae80313c852a76382","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.38-39/gitlama_0.1.0-beta.38-39_amd64.deb"}],"build":39,"channel":"beta","notes":["Fixed: while connected to another computer, local repositories could show Git commands as failed and older commits would not open until GitLama was restarted.","Remote fetch, pull, push and other operations now show their progress and result in the operation island.","Remote workspaces: when Pull, Push, Branch or other changes are unavailable for a remote repository, GitLama now tells you why, for example that you need to turn on Allow changes for the host or reconnect."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.38-39","version":"0.1.0-beta.38"}],"schema_version":1,"trust":{"checksum":"sha256","manifest_signature":"Ed25519 detached signature over exact JSON bytes","signature_encoding":"base64"}}
